	(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8: the FujiNet (fujiversal-atari5200.h pin map).\nEN: 10k / 1 uF power-on delay.  The S3_RST button, the cart RESET\n(rp-core, through the BAT54C) and the USB bridge's auto-program pair\n(usb sheet) all pull it low; S3_BOOT and the same pair pull IO0.\nIO4 / IO5 drive the RP2354B's RUN and BOOTSEL; IO19 / IO20, the\nS3's own USB, go to the RP's.\nmicroSD in SPI mode, 10k pull-ups on CS, DO, DAT1, DAT2 and CD.\nWS2812B-2020 on +5V: its data input (VIH 2.7 V) takes the S3's 3.3 V.\nThe 23 spare GPIOs (right) are not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f0276001-b74b-5999-9a7d-b7d61fb43e5c")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
